      "answer_text": "payment statement: # Incident Report — Payment Outage March\n\n## Summary\n\nPaymentService timed out for six hours on 2024-03-12 after the **auth-gateway** deploy at 08:10 UTC. [S1]. root statement: ## Root cause (ops claim)\n\nA misconfigured JWT TTL on AuthGateway caused cascading retries into PaymentService. [S2]. payment statement: PaymentService was not changed in this release. [S3]. outage statement: Release notes claim the outage was caused by a Neon connection pool exhaustion , not JWT TTL. [S4]. payment statement: Dependencies include PaymentService and AuthGateway. [S5]. payment statement: On failure, page the payments on-call and check Neon pool metrics. [S6]. outage statement: Gold span marker ALPHA-OUTAGE-0810 appears here. [S7]. payment statement: Exec Summary: March payment disruption linked to auth-gateway change; duration six hours. [S8]. root statement: Roots is the sixth studio album by Brazilian heavy metal band Sepultura. [S9]. root statement: (After leaving the band, Max Cavalera would continue to pursue the nu metal and \"world\" stylings of \"Roots\" with his solo project Soulfly.) Since its release, \"Roots\" has sold over 2 million copies wo [S10]. outage statement: The PlayStation 3 version was delayed because of the PlayStation Network outage then later released on June 14, 2011. [S11].",
